; ============================================================
;  LAYERED POUCHES - EXTRAS SLOT 01 - belt ladder
;
;  Empty on purpose. zzz_amp_layers.script reads items\amp_layers.ltx
;  first and then these eight files over the top of it, so a feature
;  mod can add a pouch, a profile or a layer rule by shipping ONE of
;  them instead of overriding the addon's whole config - which is a
;  file only one mod can win.
;
;  Later file wins on a repeated key. A key ending in _add CONCATENATES
;  instead, which is how two mods each add to the same list without
;  either knowing about the other:
;
;      [amp_layer_belt]
;      accepts_add = medical_small
;
;  CLAIMED NUMBERS - written down here because the script does not
;  enforce them:
;
;      01  belt ladder
;      02  Layered magazine pouches
;      03  Layered medical pouches
;      04  free
;      05  free
;      06  free
;      07  free
;      08  free
;
;  This stub exists so that a slot nobody has claimed is an empty file
;  rather than a missing one, which the engine would rather complain
;  about in a player's log.
; ============================================================
